      "group": "Thoracic duct system",
      "color": "#5cb86a",
      "color_linear": [
        0.10702,
        0.47932,
        0.14413
      ],
      "description": "Cisterna chyli: the sac-like start of the thoracic duct, in front of the first and second lumbar vertebrae, to the right of the aorta. The intestinal and lumbar trunks empty into it, so after a fatty meal it is full of milky chyle.",
      "alpha": 1.0,
      "category": "lymph",
      "label": true,
